OL,3,GNEWSAMP urges council to speed up
OL,4,Aheating oil payments
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has urged a council to speed up
OL,7,Fthe process of heating oil support
OL,8,Fpayments as energy prices soar.
OL,10,FAbout 23,000 Northumberland homes use
OL,11,Foil systems as they are not connected
OL,12,Fto the mains gas supply.
OL,14,FLabour's North Northumberland MP David
OL,15,FSmith said a freedom of information
OL,16,Frequest from 21 September showed just
OL,17,Fover a third of households who applied
OL,18,Ffor help with heating oil costs had
OL,19,Freceived funding from Northumberland
OL,20,FCounty Council.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
