OL,3,GNEWSAMP urges council to speed up
OL,4,Aheating oil payments
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the Conservative-led local
OL,7,Fauthority said its latest figures
OL,8,Fshowed significantly more applications
OL,9,Fhad now been approved almost two months
OL,10,Fon.
